    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> <ref refid="classDisplayNode" kindref="compound">DisplayNode</ref> used to manage a tree. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> <ref refid="classDisplayTreeNode" kindref="compound">DisplayTreeNode</ref> is a <ref refid="classDisplayGraphNode" kindref="compound">DisplayGraphNode</ref> which has only outputEdges (children) and a dedicated inputEdge (parent)<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The memory handling is done by the parent node (when parent is deleted the whole subtree, edges and additionalEdges are deleted)</para></listitem><listitem><para>each node owns the edges to the childs, parentEdge is deleted by parent </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
